---
description: Return screenshots of the running app and confirm CSS and JS loaded
alwaysApply: true
---

When doing work on this repo, return screenshots of the running app after you finish. When the work is UI or screens, return screenshots of the items you changed.

Confirm behavior and that CSS and JS loaded correctly. After changes, Tailwind CSS is often not rebuilt or something else breaks. Check that and resolve it before saying the work is complete. Screenshots must render correctly. Also return a copyable direct link to each screenshot as a reference if the image fails to render.

A screenshot of a broken unstyled page is not completion. Rebuild assets if CSS is missing, then screenshot again.
